  "applies_to": "IME Nemo 96HD panel meters MF96001 and MF96021 with an RS-485 module, per protocol PR106 (software 3.18).",
  "summary": "The Nemo 96HD is a modular 96x96 multifunction meter; with an RS-485 module it speaks Modbus/JBUS with functions 03 and 0x10. This map lists the integer measurement registers with fixed units: voltages and currents in mV/mA, power factor, frequency, THD and status values.",
